# W31b: exercises stocHast's model-level RNG features -- ran(), normal()
# and wiener -- for tests/test_stochast_rng.cpp. x never moves, so every
# stored row is an independent sample of the three RNG expressions with a
# fixed seed; the test checks their mean/variance against known values
# (uniform[0,1), normal(2,3), N(0,1) from the wiener) within a few sigma.
wiener n
x' = 0
aux rsamp=ran(1)
aux nsamp=normal(2,3)
aux wsamp=n
@ total=4000,dt=1,meth=euler,seed=1234
done
